  "question": {
    "text": "A particle performing S.H.M. starts from the equilibrium position and its time period is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math> seconds. After <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> seconds its velocity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Amplitude of oscillation is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>√</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi></mi><mi></mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2&nbsp;</mn></msqrt><mo>m</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi></mi><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2&nbsp;</mn></msqrt><mo>m</mo></math>",
